      "writtenOn": "2022-10-17T10:03:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Does `shared_libs: [\"libbinder_ndk\"]` work?\nOr `include_dirs: [\"frameworks/native/libs/binder/include\"]` ?\n\nIf not, let\u0027s stick with the forward declaration, and add this to the list of things we have to solve to make this public.",
