        "id": 1139038
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-10-14T12:27:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "For now, we\u0027d still have to implement it with vsock over to the host but maybe there are some other tricks we could play. But the most to do for this CL would be to mark the API as expecting change, if anything.",
      "parentUuid": "f45a2879_321e86af",
